evidence = "The six open dispositions at spec/layerx-merge/dispositions/d22-21.kvx:423 and spec/layerx-merge/dispositions/d22-21.kvx:459 still name task 22.31.623, marked done at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:178674 after commit 3740acfa3e25ea3b4aa157330f14dc50a37b0c47, although spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:351227 requires pending repair ownership and spec/layerx-merge/programme/closure_check.py:88 checks only existence; the issue correctly cites the skip permission at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:178682 and the older requirement at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:413055, but overlooks the explicit prohibition on skipped tests at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:25123, while tools/qualification/repair_22_31_623.kvx:20 retains eight new skips, tools/qualification/audit_repairs/test_repair_22_33_372.py:58 still skips the missing distribution, and tests/ci/test_qualification_suites_collect.py:47 accepts a passing summary, so the settlement recorded at tools/qualification/repair_22_31_623.kvx:9496 does not establish unskipped coverage or supply a pending repair owner."
close_comment = "The six open qualification findings still point to a completed task, leaving the remaining coverage without an active repair owner. A follow-up will give those findings pending repair ownership and explicit coverage obligations while preserving the existing requirement against skipped or weakened tests."

